  (title_block 
    (title "NEC V33 DUT daughter board") 
    (date "2026-09-13") 
    (rev "1.0") 
    (comment 1 "uPD70136L-16 / PLCC-68 socket / 5V")) 
  (text "Direct host interface; no additional buffers.\nFour VDD bypass capacitors; READY is active LOW, RESET is active HIGH.\nHost firmware: select 5V, configure controls, then power/reset DUT.\nCPU rated 16 MHz; host timing and operating clock require qualification.\nHost establishes valid inputs before DUT power-on; no bank-input pulls.\nSee design-notes.md for bus direction and arbitration requirements." 
    (at 157.48 267.97 0) 
    (effects 
